[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "startSeconds": 0.0,
    "endSeconds": 3.48,
    "text": "Koriang returned to his village with the kora.",
    "charStart": 0,
    "charEnd": 46
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "startSeconds": 3.48,
    "endSeconds": 13.68,
    "text": "The griots — the jalolu, the professional rememberers and praise-singers who were already the keepers of the community's history — heard him play.",
    "charStart": 48,
    "charEnd": 194
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "startSeconds": 13.68,
    "endSeconds": 16.14,
    "text": "They recognised it at once.",
    "charStart": 196,
    "charEnd": 223
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "startSeconds": 16.14,
    "endSeconds": 19.39,
    "text": "Not because they had heard anything like it before.",
    "charStart": 225,
    "charEnd": 276
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "startSeconds": 19.39,
    "endSeconds": 20.54,
    "text": "They hadn't.",
    "charStart": 277,
    "charEnd": 289
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "startSeconds": 20.54,
    "endSeconds": 27.0,
    "text": "But because they understood immediately that this was the instrument they had been waiting for without knowing they were waiting.",
    "charStart": 290,
    "charEnd": 419
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "startSeconds": 27.0,
    "endSeconds": 35.24,
    "text": "An instrument complex enough to hold the full weight of an epic.",
    "charStart": 420,
    "charEnd": 484
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "startSeconds": 35.24,
    "endSeconds": 38.72,
    "text": "Rich enough to carry emotion and narrative simultaneously.",
    "charStart": 485,
    "charEnd": 543
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "startSeconds": 38.72,
    "endSeconds": 42.22,
    "text": "Intimate enough to speak directly to a single person.",
    "charStart": 544,
    "charEnd": 597
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "startSeconds": 42.22,
    "endSeconds": 45.53,
    "text": "Powerful enough to fill a gathering of thousands.",
    "charStart": 598,
    "charEnd": 647
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "startSeconds": 45.53,
    "endSeconds": 46.74,
    "text": "The kora was, they understood, a voice.",
    "charStart": 649,
    "charEnd": 688
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "startSeconds": 46.74,
    "endSeconds": 50.08,
    "text": "Their voice.",
    "charStart": 689,
    "charEnd": 701
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "startSeconds": 50.08,
    "endSeconds": 52.21,
    "text": "The voice that the griots had been born to carry.",
    "charStart": 702,
    "charEnd": 751
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "startSeconds": 52.21,
    "endSeconds": 56.51,
    "text": "The Kouyaté lineage — descendants of Koriang — became its primary custodians.",
    "charStart": 753,
    "charEnd": 830
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "startSeconds": 56.51,
    "endSeconds": 67.5,
    "text": "The knowledge of how to build it, how to tune it, how to play it in the old way, was passed from father to son and teacher to student, uninterrupted, down the centuries.",
    "charStart": 831,
    "charEnd": 1000
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "startSeconds": 67.5,
    "endSeconds": 76.05,
    "text": "In The Gambia today, the Suso, Kouyaté, Jobarteh, and Diabaté families are among the kora's great lineages.",
    "charStart": 1002,
    "charEnd": 1109
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "startSeconds": 76.05,
    "endSeconds": 77.77,
    "text": "They are still teaching.",
    "charStart": 1110,
    "charEnd": 1134
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "startSeconds": 77.77,
    "endSeconds": 79.17,
    "text": "Still playing.",
    "charStart": 1135,
    "charEnd": 1149
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "startSeconds": 79.17,
    "endSeconds": 83.2,
    "text": "Still carrying the voice that came out of the forest at dawn.",
    "charStart": 1150,
    "charEnd": 1211
  }
]